"426":{"stem":"The function \\(f\\) is defined by \\(f(x) = \\frac{1}{10}x - 2\\). What is the \\(y\\)-intercept of the graph of \\(y = f(x)\\) in the \\(xy\\)-plane?","choices":["\\((-2, 0)\\)","\\((0, -2)\\)","\\(\\left(0, \\frac{1}{10}\\right)\\)","\\(\\left(\\frac{1}{10}, 0\\right)\\)"]},
