"449":{"stem":"\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\frac{7}{8}y - \\frac{5}{8}x &= \\frac{4}{7} - \\frac{7}{8}y \\\\ \\frac{5}{4}x + \\frac{7}{4} &= py + \\frac{15}{4} \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nIn the given system of equations, \\(p\\) is a constant. If the system has no solution, what is the value of \\(p\\)?"},
