"1065":{"stem":"In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of the equation \\(y=-x^{2}+9x-100\\) intersects the line \\(y=c\\) at exactly one point. What is the value of \\(c\\)?","choices":["\\(-\\frac{481}{4}\\)","\\(-100\\)","\\(-\\frac{319}{4}\\)","\\(-\\frac{9}{2}\\)"]},
"1066":{"stem":"\\[(x-11y)(2x-3y)-12y(-2x+3y)\\]\n\nWhich of the following is equivalent to the expression above?","choices":["\\(x-23y\\)","\\(2x^{2}-xy-3y^{2}\\)","\\(2x^{2}+24xy+36y^{2}\\)","\\(2x^{2}-49xy+69y^{2}\\)"]},
"1067":{"stem":"\\[b=42cf\\]\n\nThe given equation relates the positive numbers \\(b\\), \\(c\\), and \\(f\\). Which equation correctly expresses \\(c\\) in terms of \\(b\\) and \\(f\\)?","choices":["\\(c=\\frac{b}{42f}\\)","\\(c=\\frac{b-42}{f}\\)","\\(c=42bf\\)","\\(c=42-b-f\\)"]},
