"1073":{"stem":"\\[f(x)=\\frac{a-19}{x}+5\\]\n\nIn the given function \\(f\\), \\(a\\) is a constant. The graph of function \\(f\\) in the \\(xy\\)-plane, where \\(y=f(x)\\), is translated \\(3\\) units down and \\(4\\) units to the right to produce the graph of \\(y=g(x)\\). Which equation defines function \\(g\\)?","choices":["\\(g(x)=\\frac{a-19}{x+4}+2\\)","\\(g(x)=\\frac{a-19}{x-4}+2\\)","\\(g(x)=\\frac{a-22}{x+4}+5\\)","\\(g(x)=\\frac{a-22}{x-4}+5\\)"]},
"1074":{"stem":"\\[c-7=25p+k\\]\n\nThe given equation relates the positive numbers \\(c\\), \\(p\\), and \\(k\\). Which equation correctly expresses \\(c\\) in terms of \\(p\\) and \\(k\\)?","choices":["\\(c=25p+k+7\\)","\\(c=25p+k-7\\)","\\(c=7(25p+k)\\)","\\(c=\\frac{25p+k}{7}\\)"]},
