"1130":{"stem":"[[table]]\n\nThe table above shows the number of students from two different high schools who completed summer internships in each of five years. No student attended both schools. Of the students who completed a summer internship in 2010, which of the following represents the fraction of students who were from Valley High School?","choices":["\\(\\frac{10}{140}\\)","\\(\\frac{65}{140}\\)","\\(\\frac{75}{140}\\)","\\(\\frac{65}{75}\\)"],"table":{"title":"Number of High School Students Who Completed Summer Internships","header":true,"rows":[["High school","Year","","","",""],["","2008","2009","2010","2011","2012"],["Foothill","87","80","75","76","70"],["Valley","44","54","65","76","82"],["Total","131","134","140","152","152"]]}},
